  "description": "Export source-mix probes (export-plan-compiler.md section 4, R-091, decision 093): black and white default maps mixed (RGB, and RGB with an A), white alone, black alone; an absent Opacity at R beside BaseColor, at RGB beside a present A, and alone; a map that is written beside an unbound curvature mesh map, and beside the legacy name sheencolor (no Fuzz channel), in both orders. Each probe step names an authored export configuration (the recorder's preset uzp_recorder, PNG 16, no dithering, infinite padding, root paths s0 and s1, changed as the probe says); the recorder lists it with list_project_textures and, when that succeeds, exports it, recording Painter's answer or refusal, the directory content and the files.",
